  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper reports a hybrid ensemble for S&P 500 directional prediction that reaches 60.14% accuracy on 286 test predictions, improving over the best individual model at 57.04% and the no-quantum ensemble at 59.32%. The quantum component is a 4-qubit variational circuit implemented on PennyLane default.qubit classical simulation, contributing modest gains of +0.78% to +1.50% per model rather than demonstrating practical quantum advantage.",
